@startuml system-component
title Quiz Buzzer (課堂搶答系統) - System Components

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"

actor Teacher
actor "Student group" as Student

node "Browser" {
  [Teacher UI\nstatic/teacher.html + teacher.js] as TUI
  [Student UI\nstatic/student.html + student.js] as SUI
}

node "Local server (single process: quizbuzzer.main)" {
  [API server\napi/teacher_routes.py\napi/ws_routes.py] as API
  [Real-time channel\nrealtime/hub.py: RealtimeHub] as RT
  [Activity service\nservices/activity_service.py:\nActivityService] as ACT
  [Guided Notes parser\nservices/guided_notes_parser.py:\nparse(grid, merges)] as PARSER
  component "Sheets adapter" as SA {
    interface "SheetsAdapter" as SAI
    [GoogleSheetsAdapter\nservices/google_sheets_adapter.py] as GSAD
  }
  [URL parsing\nservices/sheets_url.py:\nparse_spreadsheet_url] as URL
  database "SQLite store\ndb.py + quizbuzzer.db" as DB
}

cloud "Google" {
  [Google Sheets API] as GSA
}

Teacher --> TUI
Student --> SUI

TUI --> API : HTTP /api/teacher/*
SUI --> API : HTTP (join, submit;\nlater feature)
RT ..> TUI : WebSocket push\n(activity state)
RT ..> SUI : WebSocket push\n(phase / own group state;\nlater feature)

API --> ACT : all commands and queries
ACT --> SAI : list_tabs(spreadsheet_id) /\nread_tab(spreadsheet_id, sheet_id)
ACT --> PARSER : parse(grid, merges)
ACT --> DB : atomic transactions
ACT --> RT : publish activity state
GSAD ..|> SAI
ACT --> URL : parse_spreadsheet_url(url)
GSAD --> GSA : spreadsheets.get, values.get (import)\nvalues.batchUpdate RAW (export, 003)

note right of PARSER
  Pure function: no network, no DB.
  Locates header (題號 / 作答),
  numbered rows and （k） markers.
  No hardcoded addresses (Constitution II).
end note

note bottom of ACT
  Sole authority for activity phase (IV),
  arrival order and winner (I),
  and visibility filtering (III).
end note

note right of SUI
  Student UI, student WebSocket and
  submissions are specified by later
  features. Tests replace
  GoogleSheetsAdapter with
  FakeSheetsAdapter (tests/fakes/).
end note

note left of API
  Teacher actions (import, preview,
  confirm, re-import, phase changes)
  require feature 002's teacher
  passcode check.
end note
@enduml
